      "body": "## Motivation\n\nThe FLUX.2 XPU fusion test added by #41942 imports `flux_2` at module scope but registers in `base-a-test-cpu`, whose environment lacks `diffusers`. The file fails before any tests run with `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'diffusers'`.\n\nThis blocks unrelated PRs, including [the CPU job on #45076](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39937200905/job/120359896858). The failing test file is identical on main at `535aeae2a709077e3d17f5efc48350319ac13fc9` and #45076 at `402c0652846c0dc6f1ce85395468de997c90c424`.\n\n## Modifications\n\nMove the non-XPU import regression to `base-b-kernel-unit-test-1-gpu-large`. Its existing workflow installs diffusion dependencies and exercises the intended CUDA-without-Intel-Triton import path. Keep the XPU registration and all test assertions unchanged.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Verified the CI registration parser selects CUDA kernel and XPU suites, with no CPU registration.\n- Verified the destination workflow installs dependencies with `ci_install_dependency.sh diffusion`.\n- All applicable pre-commit checks passed, including repository-wide registered-test validation.\n- CUDA import execution and XPU numerical tests were not run locally; CI validation remains pending.\n\nNo model or kernel implementation changes.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39942312493](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39942312493)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39942312217](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39942312217)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39942312345](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39942312345)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
